{"pair_id": "79e89edd", "question": "对于2013年的人口普查年度，列出每个分区的名称以及女性拥有的机构总数之和，按分区分组，并按总数从高到低排序。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_GENDER_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) DESC", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "64e64570", "question": "对于可获得的最新人口普查年份，列出每个分区的名称以及女性拥有的机构总数之和，按分区分组，并按数量从高到低排序。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_GENDER_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = (SELECT MAX(CENSUS_YEAR) FROM DIM_TIME) GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) DESC", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "bf70d789", "question": "对于2013年普查年度，列出各分区的名称以及每个分区中由女性拥有的机构总数，并且仅显示总数最高的前5个分区。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_GENDER_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) DESC LIMIT 5", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "1d4a3e0b", "question": "对于2013年普查年度，列出女性拥有的机构数量大于零的分区名称，并确保仅包含至少有一条记录的分区名称。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_GENDER_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' AND T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE > 0.000 GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING COUNT(T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME) > 0", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "b766b4e4", "question": "列出符合以下记录条件的sub-district名称，并按字母顺序排序：要么普查年份为2013且village名称为'Chouldari (Rv)'，要么由其他性别拥有的establishments数量为0.000，并确保每个sub-district至少存在一条时间记录。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T2.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM FACT_GENDER_OWNERSHIP AS T1 JOIN DIM_LOCATION AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T1.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE (T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' AND T2.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME = 'Chouldari (Rv)') OR T1.EST_OWNED_BY_OTHER_GENDER = 0.000 GROUP BY T2.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING COUNT(T3.TIME_ID) > 0 ORDER BY T2.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "47e9d55d", "question": "对于2013年普查年度，请列出分区名称以及 ULB/RLB 村庄名称，并按分区和村庄名称分组，给出锡克教徒拥有的机构总数。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "0783bd49", "question": "对于2013年普查年度，列出每个分区名称和 ULB/RLB 村庄名称，以及女性拥有的机构总数；仅包括女性拥有数量大于零的地点，并按总拥有量从高到低排序。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_GENDER_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) > 0.000 ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_FEMALE) DESC", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "c7d19184", "question": "对于2013年普查年度，列出分区名称以及 ULB/RLB 村庄名称，并给出锡克教徒拥有的机构总数之和；按分区和村庄名称分组，并按总和降序排列。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) DESC", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "e5c96235", "question": "对于可获得的最新人口普查年份，列出每个分区的名称，以及印度教徒拥有的机构总数、穆斯林拥有的机构总数和基督徒拥有的机构总数，并按这三类宗教所有权类别合计总数的降序排序。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_HINDU), SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_ISLAM), SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_CHRISTIAN) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = (SELECT MAX(CENSUS_YEAR) FROM DIM_TIME) GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_HINDU + T2.EST_OWNED_BY_ISLAM + T2.EST_OWNED_BY_CHRISTIAN) DESC", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
