{"pair_id": "9382a4a2", "question": "对于2013年普查年度，列出每个分区的名称以及锡克教徒拥有的机构总数之和，并按该总数降序排序。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) DESC", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "b04846f6", "question": "列出时间段 ID 为 1 的由锡克教徒拥有的机构按分区分组后的分区名称及机构总数，并按总数从高到低排序，仅显示前 5 条结果。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID WHERE T2.TIME_ID = 1 GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) DESC LIMIT 5", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "ffc386b1", "question": "列出由锡克教徒拥有的机构中零售贸易状态为“1.000”的分区名称及其机构总数，按分区分组，并按锡克教徒拥有的机构总数降序排列，返回前5个结果。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN FACT_TRADE_SECTOR AS T3 ON T2.LOCATION_ID = T3.LOCATION_ID WHERE T3.EST_RETAIL_TRADE = '1.000' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) DESC LIMIT 5", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "a80ce3c9", "question": "对于2013年人口普查年度，列出锡克教徒估计拥有比例大于或等于0.000的地区的分区名称以及ULB/RLB村庄名称，并按分区名称的字母顺序排列。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH >= 0.000 AND T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "a994e9a8", "question": "对于2013年普查年度，列出每个分区名称和 ULB/RLB 村庄名称，以及锡克教徒拥有的机构总数；其中该总数至少为零，并按总数降序排序。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' AND T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH >= 0.000 GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) >= 0.000 ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) DESC", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "4d623596", "question": "列出 Chittoor、South Andamans 和 Nicobars 各区的分区名称、ULB/RLB 村庄名称以及区名称，确保每种组合至少有一个位置 ID，并按分区名称的字母顺序对结果进行排序。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T2.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T2.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME, T1.DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_DISTRICT AS T1 INNER JOIN DIM_LOCATION AS T2 ON T1.DISTRICT_ID = T2.DISTRICT_ID WHERE T1.DISTRICT_NAME IN ('Chittoor', 'South Andamans', 'Nicobars') GROUP BY T2.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, T2.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME, T1.DISTRICT_NAME HAVING COUNT(T2.LOCATION_ID) >= 1 ORDER BY T2.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "e591a0fb", "question": "列出2013年人口普查年度中至少有一家由锡克教徒拥有的机构、但该分区内由耆那教徒拥有的机构总数恰好为零的分区名称。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' AND T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH > 0.000 GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_JAIN) = 0.000", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "2ad8247d", "question": "列出 2013 年普查中，锡克教徒拥有的机构总数大于零且耆那教徒拥有的机构总数恰好为零的所有分区名称，并按分区名称进行分组并按字母顺序排序。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) > 0.000 AND SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_JAIN) = 0.000 ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "3fffc294", "question": "列出在2013年普查年度中，锡克教徒拥有的机构总数或耆那教徒拥有的机构总数大于500的分区名称。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_RELIGIOUS_OWNERSHIP AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_SIKH) > 500 OR SUM(T2.EST_OWNED_BY_JAIN) > 500", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "f279081a", "question": "对于每个分区，列出分区名称、来自借贷机构的预计融资总额以及来自自助小组贷款的预计融资总额，并按来自借贷机构的预计融资总额降序排列。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_BORROW_INSTITUTION), SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_LOAN_SELF_HELP_GROUP) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_BORROW_INSTITUTION) DESC", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "0d4f65de", "question": "对于农村部门类别中的每个分区名称，列出该分区名称以及来自机构借款的估计融资总额和来自自助小组贷款的估计融资总额，前提是机构借款总额大于零，并按机构借款总额降序排序。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_BORROW_INSTITUTION) AS total_institutional_borrowing, SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_LOAN_SELF_HELP_GROUP) AS total_shg_loans FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 INNER JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID INNER JOIN DIM_SECTOR_CATEGORY AS T3 ON T2.SECTOR_ID = T3.SECTOR_ID WHERE T3.SECTOR_CATEGORY = 'Rural' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_BORROW_INSTITUTION) > 0.000 ORDER BY total_institutional_borrowing DESC", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "fba7fb6b", "question": "列出至少有一条财政来源记录的 ULB、RLB 或村庄名称，但要求其中预计政府援助为 0.000，且预计来自自助小组的贷款也为 0.000，并按村庄名称的字母顺序排序。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID WHERE T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE = 0.000 AND T2.EST_FINANCE_LOAN_SELF_HELP_GROUP = 0.000 GROUP BY T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME HAVING COUNT(T2.FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES_ID) > 0 ORDER BY T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "d08fd177", "question": "对于可获得的最新人口普查年份，列出每个分区名称及政府财政援助估算总额，按分区名称分组，并按援助总额从高到低排序。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = (SELECT MAX(CENSUS_YEAR) FROM DIM_TIME) GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE) DESC", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "414ab4d4", "question": "按字母顺序列出预计政府援助融资金额为 0.000 且预计自助小组贷款融资金额为 0.000 的 ULB、RLB 或村庄名称。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID WHERE T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE = 0.000 AND T2.EST_FINANCE_LOAN_SELF_HELP_GROUP = 0.000 GROUP BY T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME ORDER BY T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "a457d390", "question": "对于最近可获得的人口普查年份，按村名分组，并按政府财政援助总额降序排列，列出每个 ULB/RLB 村名以及政府财政援助估算总额和借贷机构融资估算总额。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME, SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE), SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_BORROW_INSTITUTION) FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = (SELECT MAX(CENSUS_YEAR) FROM DIM_TIME) GROUP BY T1.ULB_RLB_VILLAGE_NAME ORDER BY SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE) DESC", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "bb7e100c", "question": "列出2013年普查年度中，总估算政府援助资金大于0.000且来自贷款自助小组的总估算资金恰好等于0.000的分区名称。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE) > 0.000 AND SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_LOAN_SELF_HELP_GROUP) = 0.000", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "309a5f49", "question": "列出2013年人口普查中，总估计政府援助资金大于0.000且来自贷款自助小组的总估计资金恰好等于0.000的分区名称，并按分区名称的字母顺序排序。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T3.CENSUS_YEAR = '2013' GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE) > 0.000 AND SUM(T2.EST_FINANCE_LOAN_SELF_HELP_GROUP) = 0.000 ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "c4e8af4a", "question": "列出所有至少有一条财政来源记录且其中“预计政府财政援助”和“预计向机构借款金额”均等于 0.000 的分区名称，并按字母顺序排序。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID JOIN DIM_TIME AS T3 ON T2.TIME_ID = T3.TIME_ID WHERE T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE = 0.000 AND T2.EST_FINANCE_BORROW_INSTITUTION = 0.000 GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME HAVING COUNT(T2.FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES_ID) > 0 ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
{"pair_id": "471bea0a", "question": "列出那些政府援助估计资金为 0.000 且从机构借入的估计资金也为 0.000 的地区的分区名称，并按字母顺序排序。", "gold_sql": "SELECT T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME FROM DIM_LOCATION AS T1 JOIN FACT_FINANCE_SOURCES AS T2 ON T1.LOCATION_ID = T2.LOCATION_ID WHERE T2.EST_FINANCE_GOVT_ASSISTANCE = 0.000 AND T2.EST_FINANCE_BORROW_INSTITUTION = 0.000 GROUP BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ORDER BY T1.SUB_DISTRICT_NAME ASC", "predicted_sql": "", "raw_output": "", "em": 0, "ex": 0, "error": "Empty prediction"}
